<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-fury-warrior-dps">Wrist for Fury Warrior DPS</h4>Despite their expense, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71261/gigantiform-bracers">
