<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Fury Warrior DPS</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="weapons-for-fury-warrior-dps">Weapons for Fury Warrior DPS</h4>In the current patch, SMF focused builds vastly outscale TG focused builds. As such, One handed weapons are the focus of Fury Warriors, and several are easily available. The best available option will be the BoE from the new raid, but there are several other options available<br/>
